<table cellspacing="0" class="whs19">
<col>
<col>
<tr>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/3DSmp.htm">3DSmp</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Fits a cubic grid to the selected scan data. In each cube of the grid one point is kept, all other points are discarded. The resulting entity is point cloud.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="A"></a><a href="Commands/AlignEntities.htm">AlignEntities</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Applies best fit algorithm and changes the position/orientation of the selected entity in order to get maximum overlapping of the reference and the entity that is moved/rotated.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/ApplyToSelection.htm">ApplyToSelection</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Transforms visible selected entities from the global co-ordinate system to the co-ordinate system defined by the given transformation.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/AreaSmp.htm">AreaSmp</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Samples the selected scan data patch by patch. A rectangular array of points is calculated for each patch.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/AutoCircleExtract.htm">AutoCircleExtract</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Auto-extracts circles from selected meshes.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/AutoConeExtract.htm">AutoConeExtract</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Auto-extracts cones from selected meshes.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/AutoCylinderExtract.htm">AutoCylinderExtract</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Auto-extracts cylinders from selected meshes.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/AutoPlaneExtract.htm">AutoPlaneExtract</a></p>
