<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Sets left view.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/LinearSmp.htm">LinearSmp</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Reduces the size of selected scan data by removing points from each stripe.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Lock.htm">Lock</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Lock an entity in space</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="M"></a></u><a href="Commands/Measure_2DLine.htm">Measure_2DLine</a></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Measures 2D line(s) - tactile method only.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Measure_2DPoint.htm">Measure_2DPoint</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Measures 2D point(s) - tactile method only.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Measure_Circle.htm">Measure_Circle</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Measures circle(s) - tactile or scan method.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Measure_Plane.htm">Measure_Plane</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Measures plane(s) - tactile or scan method.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/Merge.htm">Merge</a></u></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Merges the selected scan data and produces mesh.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Message.htm">Message</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Displays user text in pedal or standard Windows dialog.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Mirror.htm">Mirror</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Mirrors the selected entities</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/ModRadius.htm">ModRadius</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Modifies radius of datum circle/sphere.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/MshNormalsInv.htm">MshNormalsInv</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Inverts the normals of all selected polygons.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/MshNormalsUnify.htm">MshNormalsUnify</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Unifies all the polygon normals in the selected mesh.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/MshRedNoiseAvg.htm">MshRedNoiseAvg</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Reduces noise in selected meshes by applying an average (Laplacian) filter.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="N"></a><a href="Commands/New.htm">New</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Opens a blank document.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/NewEntityFromSel.htm">NewEntityFromSel</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Removes the visible selection and generates a copy of it as separate entity.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="O"></a></u><a href="Commands/OffsetPts.htm">OffsetPts</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Offsets selected entities along the normal toward the sensor<span class="glossterm">.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/Open.htm">Open</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Opens an existing file format recognised by KUBE in a new window.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/OpenInDoc.htm">OpenInDoc</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Opens an existing file format recognised by KUBE in the current window.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/OptMeshes.htm">OptMeshes</a></u></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Reduces the noise in selected meshes by aligning mesh patches.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/OptScan.htm">OptScan</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Reduces the noise in selected scan data by aligning patches.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="P"></a><a href="Commands/Paste.htm">Paste</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Moves the data from the clipboard into the active document.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="R"></a><a href="Commands/RedNoiseByCrv.htm">RedNoiseByCrv</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Reduces noise in selected meshes by applying the filter with more strength on flatter surfaces and with less strength on more curved surfaces.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/RedNoiseMedian.htm">RedNoiseMedian</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Reduces noise in the selected scan data by applying a median filter on each stripe.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Redraw.htm">Redraw</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Refreshes the view.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/ReorgMsh.htm">ReorgMsh</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Reorganises selected mesh edges to follow detection feature lines (e.g. corners).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Repair.htm">Repair</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Removes faulty areas and fills them afterwards.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Reverse.htm">Reverse</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Reverses normal / direction of datum entity.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Right.htm">Right</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Sets right view.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/RmDuplTri.htm">RmDuplTri</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Finds any triangles that have identical vertices in the mesh and removes the surplus triangles.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/RmFaultyAreas.htm">RmFaultyAreas</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Removes selected triangles, which planes form 3D angle less than the given degree.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/RmFloatingMsh.htm">RmFloatingMsh</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Removes regions of selected object, which are isolated from the main mesh.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/RunExternalSoftware.htm">RunExternalSoftware</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Loads the current document in an external application.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/RunProcess.htm">RunProcess</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Calls an external application.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/RunScript.htm">RunScript</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Calls a script file for execution.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="S"></a><a href="Commands/Save.htm">Save</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Saves the current document.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SaveAs.htm">SaveAs</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Saves the current document under different name.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SaveCopy.htm">SaveCopy</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Saves the current document under the name <i>CopyOf</i>FileName.sab2.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/ScalePts.htm">ScalePts</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Scales the selected entities.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/ScanNormalsInv.htm">ScanNormalsInv</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Inverts the normals of all selected scan data vertices.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/ScanRedNoiseAvg.htm">ScanRedNoiseAvg</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Reduces noise in the selected scan data by applying an average (Laplacian) filter.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelAll.htm">SelAll</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Selects all visible entities.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelBndMsh.htm">SelBndMsh</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Selects boundary triangles of visible meshes.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelBndScan.htm">SelBndScan</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Selects boundary triangles of visible scans.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelByCrv.htm">SelByCrv</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Computes the curvature per visible point comparing it's normal and it's neighbour's normal, decides whether it is a curved or a flat surface and selects it if it falls into curved area.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelByEdge.htm">SelByEdge</a></u></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Selects visible triangles of scan data based on the length of their sides.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelByPtNormal.htm">SelByPtNormal</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Select part of a visible scan based on the angle at which the points were scanned.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelElp.htm">SelElp</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Selects all visible points and whole visible entities that are inside an ellipse.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelEntity.htm">SelEntity</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Selects specific entity.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelEntityByPt.htm">SelEntityByPt</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Selects the top-most entity on which the point is located.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelEntityType.htm">SelEntityType</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Selects all entities from a specific type.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelFront.htm">SelFront</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Sets front-facing mode. When this mode is enabled, all shape selections will select only the scan data and mesh triangles, which normals face front towards the viewport.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelInv.htm">SelInv</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Selects all visible unselected entities (or parts of them) and deselects all selected and visible entities (or parts of them).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelPolygon.htm">SelPolygon</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Selects all visible points and whole visible entities that are inside a polygon or a free-form shape.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelRect.htm">SelRect</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Selects all visible points and whole visible entities that are inside a rectangle.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelReverseScans.htm">SelReverseScans</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Select parts of a visible scan captured while scanning in reverse direction.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelThinTriMesh.htm">SelThinTriMesh</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Selects areas of visible meshes containing triangles having an angle smaller than the given value.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SelThinTriScan.htm">SelThinTriScan</a></u></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Selects areas of visible scans containing triangles having an angle smaller than the given value.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/SetProfile.htm">SetProfile</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Sets the given profile as current.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SetView.htm">SetView</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Changes the current viewpoint.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/ShowAll.htm">ShowAll</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Displays all hidden entities (or those parts of them that are hidden.)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/ShowEntity.htm">ShowEntity</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Shows specific entity.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SmoothBnd.htm">SmoothBnd</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Smoothes boundaries of a mesh selection by creating more triangles.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SplitMesh.htm">SplitMesh</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Splits floating meshes from the selected object into separate mesh entities.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/SplitScan.htm">SplitScan</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Splits selected scan data into entities containing single patches.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Start2Macros.htm">Start2Macros</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Defines a toolbar with 2 large buttons and custom scripts assigned to each button.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/Stitch.htm">Stitch</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Attempts to fill gaps in the mesh areas by joining the boundaries of long thin holes.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/Subdivide.htm">Subdivide</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="34" valign="top" class="whs22">
<p>Subdivides larger triangles within the selected mesh areas into smaller ones.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a name="T"></a><a href="Commands/TrimPatches.htm">TrimPatches</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Removes the overlapping points on scan data patches at given overlapping distance.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="U"></a><a href="Commands/Undo.htm">Undo</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Restores the previous state of data in the scene.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Unlock.htm">Unlock</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Unlocks an entity in space.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/UnselAll.htm">UnselAll</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Unselects all visible entities.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/UnSelEntity.htm">UnSelEntity</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Unselects specific entity.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="Commands/UnselEntityType.htm">UnselEntityType</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Unselects all entities from a specific type.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/Up.htm">Up</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Sets up view.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><a href="Commands/UpdateCurrentCS.htm">UpdateCurrentCS</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Updates the current co-ordinate system with the given transformation.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p class="whs21"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="V"></a><a href="Commands/VolSmp.htm">VolSmp</a></u></p>
</td>
<td height="51" valign="top" class="whs20">
<p>Fits a cubic grid to the selected meshes. In each cube of the grid one point is kept, all other points are discarded. The resulting entity is point cloud.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p class="whs21"><span style="color:#0000ff;"><font color="blue"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a name="W"></a><a href="Commands/Weld.htm">Weld</a></u></font></span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Removes selected surplus triangles.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p><a name="Z"></a><a href="Commands/ZoomAll.htm">ZoomAll</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Resets the view extents to fit the visible data.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p><a href="Commands/ZoomIn.htm">ZoomIn</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Magnifies the visible data twice.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p><a href="Commands/ZoomOut.htm">ZoomOut</a></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Recedes the visible data twice.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p><a href="Commands/ZoomSel.htm">ZoomSel</a></p>
</td>
<td height="21" valign="top" class="whs23">
<p>Resets the view extents to fit the visible selected data.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
